{"unit_id": "tag:077P:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 范畴（category）<MATH_0002>是一个 Grothendieck 阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）。因此，<MATH_0003>有足够多的内射对象（injectives），并且有所有极限（limits）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 包含函子（inclusion functor）\n<MATH_0004>\n有右伴随（right adjoint）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>这个函子（functor）有时称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>拟凝聚化函子（coherator）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>\n<MATH_0005>，使得对每个拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0006>，伴随（adjunction）映射\n<MATH_0007>是同构（isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": ["Grothendieck"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "abelian category", "target_term": "阿贝尔范畴"}, {"source_term": "injectives", "target_term": "内射对象"}, {"source_term": "limits", "target_term": "极限"}, {"source_term": "inclusion functor", "target_term": "包含函子"}, {"source_term": "right adjoint", "target_term": "右伴随"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "coherator", "target_term": "拟凝聚化函子"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "adjunction", "target_term": "伴随"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "命题的基础空间"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "所讨论的范畴"}, {"source_term": "abelian category", "target_term": "阿贝尔范畴", "context": "Grothendieck 所修饰的范畴类型"}, {"source_term": "injectives", "target_term": "内射对象", "context": "范畴中有足够多的此类对象"}, {"source_term": "limits", "target_term": "极限", "context": "范畴中存在的极限"}, {"source_term": "inclusion functor", "target_term": "包含函子", "context": "从子范畴到环境范畴"}, {"source_term": "right adjoint", "target_term": "右伴随", "context": "包含函子的伴随方向"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "脚注指称右伴随"}, {"source_term": "coherator", "target_term": "拟凝聚化函子", "context": "脚注给出该右伴随的别名"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "伴随映射的适用对象"}, {"source_term": "adjunction", "target_term": "伴随", "context": "修饰所述映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "伴随映射的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:077P:proof", "translation": "第（1）部分是说<MATH_0001>满足：（a）有所有余极限（colimits），（b）滤过余极限（filtered colimits）是正合（exact）的，（c）有生成元（generator）。见内射对象（Injectives）一章的第<REF_0001>节。\n由概形（Schemes）一章的第<REF_0002>节可知，<MATH_0002>中的余极限（colimits）存在，且与<MATH_0003>中的余极限（colimits）一致。由模（Modules）一章的引理<REF_0003>可知，滤过余极限（filtered colimits）是正合（exact）的。因此（a）和（b）成立。\n为构造生成元（generator）<MATH_0004>，选取一个基数（cardinal）<MATH_0005>，如引理<REF_0004>所述。选取一族<MATH_0006>由<MATH_0007>生成（generated）的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves），如引理<REF_0005>所述。令<MATH_0008>。由于任一对象（object），只要它属于<MATH_0009>，就是一个滤过余极限（filtered colimit），所取的是由<MATH_0010>生成（generated）的拟凝聚模（coherent modules），也就是说，所取对象（objects）均与<MATH_0011>同构（isomorphic），所以<MATH_0012>显然是一个生成元（generator）。\n关于极限（limits）和内射对象（injectives）的断言在任意 Grothendieck 阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）中都成立，见内射对象（Injectives）一章的定理<REF_0006>和引理<REF_0007>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n第（2）部分的证明。为构造<MATH_0013>，采用以下一般步骤。\n给定对象（object）<MATH_0014>，它属于<MATH_0015>，考虑函子（functor）\n<MATH_0016>\n这个函子（functor）把余极限（colimits）变为极限（limits），因而是可表（representable）的，见内射对象（Injectives）一章的引理<REF_0008>。\n因此存在一个拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0017>和一个函子性（functorial）的同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0018>，其中<MATH_0019>属于<MATH_0020>。由米田引理（Yoneda lemma）（范畴（Categories）一章的引理<REF_0009>），构造<MATH_0021>关于<MATH_0022>具有函子性（functorial）。由构造可知，<MATH_0023>是右伴随（right adjoint），与之伴随的是包含函子（inclusion functor）。\n<MATH_0024>是同构（isomorphism），只要<MATH_0025>是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的。这是包含函子（inclusion functor）\n<MATH_0026>\n全忠实（fully faithful）的形式推论。\n", "allowed_english": ["Grothendieck", "a", "b", "c"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimits", "target_term": "滤过余极限"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合"}, {"source_term": "generator", "target_term": "生成元"}, {"source_term": "Injectives", "target_term": "内射对象"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimits", "target_term": "滤过余极限"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合"}, {"source_term": "generator", "target_term": "生成元"}, {"source_term": "cardinal", "target_term": "基数"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimit", "target_term": "滤过余极限"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "coherent modules", "target_term": "拟凝聚模"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "generator", "target_term": "生成元"}, {"source_term": "limits", "target_term": "极限"}, {"source_term": "injectives", "target_term": "内射对象"}, {"source_term": "abelian category", "target_term": "阿贝尔范畴"}, {"source_term": "Injectives", "target_term": "内射对象"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "limits", "target_term": "极限"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "Injectives", "target_term": "内射对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性"}, {"source_term": "right adjoint", "target_term": "右伴随"}, {"source_term": "inclusion functor", "target_term": "包含函子"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "inclusion functor", "target_term": "包含函子"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限", "context": "条件（a）断言存在性"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimits", "target_term": "滤过余极限", "context": "条件（b）断言正合性"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合", "context": "条件（b）的性质"}, {"source_term": "generator", "target_term": "生成元", "context": "条件（c）断言存在性"}, {"source_term": "Injectives", "target_term": "内射对象", "context": "条件出处所在章名"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "余极限性质出处所在章名"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限", "context": "前一范畴中的余极限"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限", "context": "后一范畴中的余极限"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "正合性出处所在章名"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimits", "target_term": "滤过余极限", "context": "由所引引理得到正合性"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合", "context": "所引引理给出的性质"}, {"source_term": "generator", "target_term": "生成元", "context": "本段要构造的对象"}, {"source_term": "cardinal", "target_term": "基数", "context": "依引理选取的大小"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "所选各层的生成条件"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "所选的一族层"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "所讨论范畴中的任一对象"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimit", "target_term": "滤过余极限", "context": "表示任一对象所用的余极限"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "余极限所用模的生成条件"}, {"source_term": "coherent modules", "target_term": "拟凝聚模", "context": "术语库存匹配原文 quasi-coherent modules 的后段，汉译保留拟凝聚限定"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象", "context": "用来取余极限的一族对象"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "修饰用来取余极限的对象"}, {"source_term": "generator", "target_term": "生成元", "context": "构造得出的对象的性质"}, {"source_term": "limits", "target_term": "极限", "context": "被援引的一般断言"}, {"source_term": "injectives", "target_term": "内射对象", "context": "被援引的一般断言"}, {"source_term": "abelian category", "target_term": "阿贝尔范畴", "context": "Grothendieck 所修饰的范畴类型"}, {"source_term": "Injectives", "target_term": "内射对象", "context": "相应定理和引理所在章名"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "构造中给定的对象"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "构造中考虑的函子"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "把余极限变为极限的函子"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限", "context": "被函子转化的对象"}, {"source_term": "limits", "target_term": "极限", "context": "转化所得的对象"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表", "context": "由转化性质推出的函子性质"}, {"source_term": "Injectives", "target_term": "内射对象", "context": "可表性引理所在章名"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "表征该函子的层"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性", "context": "存在的同构具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "所给出的对应"}, {"source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理", "context": "推出构造的函子性"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "米田引理所在章名"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性", "context": "构造关于所给对象的性质"}, {"source_term": "right adjoint", "target_term": "右伴随", "context": "所构造的伴随方向"}, {"source_term": "inclusion functor", "target_term": "包含函子", "context": "与所构造的函子伴随"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "拟凝聚情形中映射的性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "该映射为同构的条件"}, {"source_term": "inclusion functor", "target_term": "包含函子", "context": "其全忠实性给出结论"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实", "context": "包含函子的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:07ZM:title", "translation": "支集（support）包含在闭子集（closed subset）中的截面（Sections）", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "support", "target_term": "支集"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "Sections", "target_term": "截面"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "support", "target_term": "支集", "context": "截面的支集"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "包含支集的子集"}, {"source_term": "Sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "标题所讨论的截面"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:07ZM:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n给定任意拓扑空间（topological space）<MATH_0001>、一个闭子集（closed subset）<MATH_0002>和一个阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0003>，可以取由支集（support）包含在<MATH_0004>中的截面（sections）构成的子层（subsheaf）。若<MATH_0005>是一个概形（scheme），<MATH_0006>是一个闭子概形（closed subscheme），且<MATH_0007>是一个拟凝聚模（coherent module），则可采用一种变体，取在概形（scheme）意义下支撑（supported）于<MATH_0008>上的截面（sections）。不过，在概形（scheme）的情形中须谨慎，因为所得的<MATH_0009>-模（module）未必是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "support", "target_term": "支集"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "subsheaf", "target_term": "子层"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "coherent module", "target_term": "拟凝聚模"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "supported", "target_term": "支撑"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "第一种构造的基础空间"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "限制支集的子集"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层", "context": "取子层所用的原层"}, {"source_term": "support", "target_term": "支集", "context": "对截面施加限制的对象"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "构成该子层的截面"}, {"source_term": "subsheaf", "target_term": "子层", "context": "由符合支集条件的截面构成"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第二种构造的基础空间"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "限制截面支撑的子概形"}, {"source_term": "coherent module", "target_term": "拟凝聚模", "context": "术语库存匹配原文 quasi-coherent module 的后段，汉译保留拟凝聚限定"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "明确支撑条件所取的意义"}, {"source_term": "supported", "target_term": "支撑", "context": "截面满足的条件"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "在概形意义下受支撑的截面"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "后一构造的情形"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "所得对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "所得模未必具有的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01PH:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是一个开子概形（open subscheme）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>中是逆紧（retrocompact）的，\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0005>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的，\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0006>是有限（finite）个仿射开集（affine opens）的并（union），且\n<STRUCT_0005> 存在一个有限型（finite type）拟凝聚理想层（quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals）<MATH_0007>，使得<MATH_0008>（在集合（set）意义下）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "retrocompact", "target_term": "逆紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals", "target_term": "拟凝聚理想层"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "对基础概形的假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "对基础概形的另一假设"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理的基础空间"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "要比较其性质的对象"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "以下四个条件的逻辑关系"}, {"source_term": "retrocompact", "target_term": "逆紧", "context": "第一项条件"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "第二项条件"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第三项限制开集数目"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第三项取并所用的开集"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并", "con